    "reviews": {
      "r1": "At first glance, we’re very satisfied with the quality of the mats and how well they fit. I hope that during use and cleaning everything will be just as great. 🤗",
      "r2": "Very nice and well-fitted — I recommend them. I’ll see how they perform in winter when there’s slush and mud, but for now I’m very satisfied. The mats are installed in an Opel Mokka X.",
      "r3": "The mats are great! A perfect fit, and the holes for the fasteners are exactly where they should be. The only minor downside is that the mat for the center tunnel has flaps that are about 0.5 cm too long — but that’s nothing to worry about! Excellent product! I’ll be recommending them and will definitely come back again more than once.",
      "r4": "The execution of a custom-made order has never been completed so quickly before. I’m very satisfied with the mats, even though at first I wanted to change the order and take only the front ones – luckily I didn’t. Dirt comes off easily, whereas with fabric mats you need to vacuum them. I also got a heel pad for free, though it’s a pity I didn’t know it wouldn’t be metal – I would have added one, as it looks nicer. The mats look solid, fit perfectly – after all, they’re custom-made. The communication during the order was great; the lady showed me photos of different colors, which made my decision much easier. I know that when I change my car, I’ll order again. I recommend it to everyone!",
      "r5": "The mats are made with incredible precision.\nIn my car there was a “problem” with the emergency hammer on the driver’s side. Carvion contacted me right away, and we agreed they would send me a template so everything would fit perfectly. I returned the template with the hammer’s spot marked out. Unfortunately, this extended the production time, but together we decided it was the best solution. And how did it turn out? Judge for yourselves.\nFor me, it’s perfect 🤩 Highly recommend ❤️\nPeugeot 308 estate, 2015.",
      "r6": "The 3D mats fit perfectly in my Mazda 6 (2002). The mats are precisely measured and shaped to match the floor surface. Since the car doesn’t have any stoppers, Velcro was applied to the corners of each mat to prevent them from moving while driving. I ordered the full option along with a trunk mat that covers the entire surface. Every element of this order is very well made. I’m satisfied and recommend them 100%!",
      "r7": "Top-class mats. They’re a bit pricey, but you pay for quality. I might buy a trunk mat in the future as well.",
      "r8": "Highly recommend — very, very nice, comfortable, and they look great. I definitely recommend them!",
      "r9": "This is our second set for a second car. They look great, are light, easy to keep clean and fit very well. The order was completed quickly and communication was excellent.",
      "r10": "The mats fit the vehicle perfectly. Ordering was simple; because the manufacturer offered two versions, I was asked for a few extra measurements. Delivery was quick.",
      "r11": "The order was handled very efficiently, the service was professional and the mats fit perfectly. I recommend them.",
      "r12": "Everything went smoothly from placing the order to receiving the mats. Communication with the company was excellent.",
      "r13": "I ordered front, rear and boot mats. They fit very well, install and remove easily, and wash quickly. I would choose the raised-edge version next time.",
      "r14": "This is the third car we have fitted with these mats. Every detail is well matched, and whenever anything was unclear, consultation and photos resolved it.",
      "r15": "After about two weeks, the mats fit the interior very well, do not move, are easy to clean and look great. So far I am very satisfied.",
      "r16": "The mats look neat, are shaped perfectly for the car and clip into the original fastening points without difficulty. The order was completed quickly.",
      "r17": "The centre-tunnel mat protects the middle of the floor very effectively. It fits well, is easy to keep clean and gives the interior a tidy finish.",
      "r18": "This is my second set. The first set, bought for another car about three years ago, still looks like new. The newer raised-edge version is especially impressive.",
      "r19": "Excellent workmanship, a perfect fit and an elegant appearance. The material looks very good in the car and I am very happy with the purchase.",
      "r20": "The mats fit almost to the millimetre. Telephone and email communication was excellent, and the team asked for photos and measurements to make sure everything matched.",
      "r21": "The mats are excellent. Very well made and a great fit. Fitted in a Honda HR-V 3.",
      "r22": "Highly recommended. Everything as requested. The mats are cut and shaped to measure. Mondeo 5, 2018.",
      "r23": "The mats are outstanding. A perfect fit and they look great. I also rate the service and contact with the seller 10/10. Recommended with all my heart ;)",
      "r24": "The mats are great, they lie perfectly and look phenomenal — I recommend them to everyone, they're worth it. Mine are black with black edging and 3D raised edges.",
      "r25": "The order took a week. The mats don't just look beautiful — they fit perfectly and meet all my expectations. I warmly recommend them.",
      "r26": "The whole ordering process was fully professional, the order was completed quickly, the mats are very well made and the materials are high quality.",
      "r27": "Phenomenal mats, great build quality and an undeniably perfect fit :) great service and express turnaround — just order and enjoy top-class mats! Warmly recommended.",
      "r28": "Customer service at a high level. The communication and the speed of the order deserve five stars. The mats fit perfectly. To me the car interior simply looks great 😊",
      "r29": "5/5, brilliant. The boot looks best :) the others too, of course. Recommended — professional work. The car instantly gained value :) Service, contact and turnaround at a very high level.",
      "r30": "The mats look beautiful in the car and they're very practical too. They trap dust and dirt well and are easy to clean. Very good build quality, highly recommended.",
      "r31": "I ordered mats for a 2026 Volvo XC40. They arrived on time and they're great — they cover more of the floor than the originals, fit very well and make it easy to keep the car tidy.",
      "r32": "Mats ordered for a Volvo XC60. First impression: great — a perfect fit and much more floor coverage than the factory mats. We'll see how they hold up over time :)",
      "r33": "Fast turnaround and professional handling of the order. The product meets my expectations and requirements; I hope it will serve just as well in use…",
      "r34": "Complete professionalism. The mats fit perfectly everywhere. Precisely cut. They look very nice. Highly recommended. I'll definitely come back to this company for more. Peugeot 5008 2.0 GT Pack.",
      "r35": "The mats are brilliant, great quality, super precise workmanship, every detail shaped as it should be. I waited 10 days for the order, exactly as I was told, and questions were answered without any problem…",
      "r36": "Very fast turnaround, 100% as ordered. Being able to choose the colours and the pattern is a great option. Very good quality mats — I hope they'll last in this car for years.",
      "r37": "I highly recommend these car mats! A perfect fit, solidly made and easy to keep clean. They protect the car floor brilliantly from mud, sand and moisture. Once fitted, they don't slide…",
      "r38": "Very professional and fast. I bought mats for one car and after a month of use I decided to buy them for the second one too. If you want to stop sand getting under the mats, I recommend the ones with raised edges…",
      "r39": "Perfectly sewn, perfectly fitting mats 🤍 You can see the quality straight away: straight seams, neat edging, solid material and a perfect fit, as if they were made just for this car.",
      "r40": "The mats fit perfectly, great material, easy to clean. You have to wait a little for the order, but the estimated delivery time is given when you order, so there's nothing to complain about 😉",
      "r41": "The mats are really great. They fit perfectly — to the millimetre, I think. Excellent contact with the company (by phone and email). Great order handling.",
      "r42": "Great mats. They fit my Honda HR-V perfectly. If you care about looks and style as well as practicality, then “I RECOMMEND THEM”."
    }
  },
